        "source_solution": "Full 823 a-h: sqrt45,-sqrt50,sqrt28,-sqrt108,sqrt(5a),-sqrt(72c),sqrt(3x/2),-sqrt(4y/3). The last four retain original domains a,c,x,y>=0. A negative expression is the negative of an arithmetic square root, not the arithmetic square root itself.",
