        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "Extract numeric and monomial square factors, leaving the unsquared variable factor under the radical.",
        "source_solution": "Full 826 a-f: a sqrt7,-y sqrt10,4x sqrtx,0.1b^2 sqrtb,5a^3 sqrt(2a),-3c^3 sqrt3. For this unit: 16x^3=(4x)^2*x;0.01b^5=(0.1b^2)^2*b;50a^7=(5a^3)^2*2a. Given nonnegative/positive variables resolve all extracted absolute values.",
        "unit_reason": "Odd exponent and numeric-square extraction are grouped into one multiple task, rather than splitting each monomial into separate coefficient and exponent slots.",
